| `TM_MM_FDRM_MBER_INFO` | `MBER_STAT_CD` | MM010 | `CRM_MEMBER` | **MM010** | `MBER_STAT_NM` |
| `TM_MM_FDRM_MBER_IRSD` | `AREA_CD` | CM011 | `CRM_MEMBER_AMT_CHANGE` | **CM018** ⚠️ | `AREA_NM` |
| `TM_MM_FDRM_MBER_DVLP_AMT` | `AREA_CD` | CM018 | `CRM_MEMBER_DEV` | **CM018** | `AREA_NM` |
